  "description_short": "Local Knysna pub serving grills and pub favourites in a relaxed, unpretentious atmosphere on Main Road.",
  "description_long": "Ingoma Pub & Grill is a straightforward local watering hole on Knysna's Main Road, offering honest pub grub and grills without the fuss. The atmosphere is laid-back and unpretentious — the kind of place where you can settle in for a casual meal and a drink after exploring the town.\n\nThe menu covers the pub classics: grills, burgers, and hearty plates that satisfy without breaking the bank. It's a no-frills spot that does what it says on the tin, making it a decent option when you're after something simple and affordable in central Knysna. The vibe is more about easy-going locals and travellers grabbing a bite than fancy dining experiences.\n\nWhile it may not be the flashiest spot in town, Ingoma fills a gap for budget-conscious diners looking for familiar comfort food in a relaxed pub setting. Expect straightforward service, cold beers, and plates that won't leave your wallet empty.",
